# Image to Text (OCR - Optical Character Recognition)

This project here is for OCR project. 
THIS IS A LOCALLY DEPLOYABLE PROJECT

It does two things :
    - Image / Document / PDF to text retrieval
        - Tools used 
            - 'pytesseract'     --> Scanned documents, books, clean PDFs                (works with images, and different document types)
    - Hardwriting (image) to text retrieval
        -  TrOCR (Transformer-based OCR) by microsoft